WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.690
Let us briefly consider God's purpose in
creating humanity, and humanity's fall.

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:09.470
God created humanity in His image and
according to His likeness.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.310
His image is for expressing God.

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:17.251
After we are saved, we need to grow in
life and be conformed to the image of the

00:00:17.251 --> 00:00:17.930
Lord Jesus.

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:20.870
What we live out is Christ living within
us.

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:28.267
He also wants humanity to rule and subdue
the earth. Ruling is like being a king;

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:30.410
subduing implies an enemy.

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:40.479
God blessed humanity to multiply, fill the
earth, subdue it, and rule over the sea,

00:00:40.479 --> 00:00:41.870
land, and air.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:48.990
This was the destiny God gave humanity.

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:57.614
Human beings are like vessels. Our own
life cannot express God or fulfill this

00:00:57.614 --> 00:00:59.430
ruling and subduing.

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:04.390
We need God as our true content and life
within.

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:14.520
Sadly, Adam was tempted by Satan,
rebelled, and received Satan's evil life.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:18.940
Humanity repeatedly fell into sin, turning
away from and rebelling against God.

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:27.340
After four falls and failures, human
government arose to maintain order on
earth.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:36.220
But behind human kingdoms, Satan exercises
power. This is called Satan's kingdom.

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:42.640
Evil spirits in the air exercise influence
over earthly nations.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:47.040
Now, the origin and outcome of Satan's
kingdom.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:56.095
God did not create Satan. Before creating
all things, God made angels as ministering

00:01:56.095 --> 00:01:56.860
spirits.

00:01:56.860 --> 00:02:01.260
They were to serve as helpers to the
believers.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:09.260
God entrusted the world to the highest
archangel, called Lucifer, to rule over
it.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:17.418
But he was ungrateful, claimed God's gifts
of wisdom, beauty, and status as his own,

00:02:17.418 --> 00:02:19.640
and sought equality with God.

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:27.069
He led a third of the angels to rebel
against God and became Satan, meaning

00:02:27.069 --> 00:02:28.060
adversary.

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:32.720
He opposes God in everything.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:44.500
For a detailed explanation, see message
two of the Life-study of Genesis.

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:52.143
The devil is Satan's title in his work.
Satan describes him as the adversary who

00:02:52.143 --> 00:02:53.040
opposes God.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:59.420
The devil's tactic is accusation.

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:02.060
He accuses people before God.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:04.280
He accuses God before people.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:07.780
And he causes people to accuse one
another.

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:14.860
So much strife and conflict comes from the
devil's schemes behind the scenes.
